# CROTA2 = -40 with |CDELT1| != |CDELT2| (lambda = CDELT2/CDELT1 enters the
# off-diagonal terms) and a CROTA1 that must be ignored (only the latitude
# axis's CROTA counts). Synthetic.
NOTE pipeline: CROTA2 with unequal CDELT, CROTA1 ignored
GRID 1 512 9 1 512 9
PIX 256.5 256.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 512
NAXIS2  = 512
CTYPE1  = 'RA---SIN'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--SIN'
CRVAL1  = 10.0
CRVAL2  = -45.0
CRPIX1  = 256.5
CRPIX2  = 256.5
CDELT1  = -0.002
CDELT2  = 0.0005
CROTA1  = 11.0
CROTA2  = -40.0
